# {{.AppTitle}} SDK

Official SDK for the {{.AppTitle}} API. Multi-language support for Go, TypeScript, Ruby, Swift, and Kotlin.

## Quick Start

### Go

```go
import "{{.ModulePath}}"

client := {{.AppName}}.NewClient({{.AppName}}.WithToken("your-token"))
projects, err := client.Projects.List(ctx)
```

### TypeScript

```typescript
import { {{.AppTitle}}Client } from '{{.NpmScope}}/{{.AppName}}-sdk'

const client = new {{.AppTitle}}Client({ token: 'your-token' })
const projects = await client.projects.list()
```

### Ruby

```ruby
require '{{.RubyGem}}'

client = {{.AppTitle}}::Client.new(token: 'your-token')
projects = client.projects.list
```

## Development

```bash
make check          # Run all checks
make go-test        # Tests for one language (go, ts, rb, swift, kt)
make conformance    # Run cross-language conformance tests
```

